WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,760
Bet if you feel like gambling

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:04,720
You said it yourself

3
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:05,760
so many people watching

4
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:08,320
Don’t regret it then, don’t worry

5
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,280
I, Zhang Yuhan, keep my word

6
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:14,000
Verified by the verification control room

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,480
When Teacher Li enters school in the morning

8
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:16,400
Not found on the neck

9
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,800
What to wear with any gestures

10
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:21,370
I remembered it wrong

11
00:00:21,370 --> 00:00:23,890
Full monitoring schools have dropped out if that makes sense

12
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:25,450
You can go to the monitoring room to check at any time

13
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:29,620
Tingting, it’s okay, Teacher Li

14
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:31,060
Now what else do you have to say

15
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:33,460
Me I really didn’t mean it

16
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:36,470
You are in front of so many people

17
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:37,910
A thief in one mouthful

18
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:39,070
A poor man in one mouthful

19
00:00:39,770 --> 00:00:41,330
Forcing a child to be like this

20
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:43,590
I really apologize

21
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:45,230
Just apologizing is not enough

22
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,030
Now it's your turn to keep your promise

23
00:00:47,030 --> 00:00:48,910
I can't do it myself

24
00:00:48,910 --> 00:00:51,180
I have taught for more than twenty years

25
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:57,700
I'll retire in a few years

26
00:00:57,700 --> 00:01:03,060
Don't you know you're wrong? Please

27
00:01:03,060 --> 00:01:04,180
it's my fault

28
00:01:04,180 --> 00:01:05,460
It's really my fault

29
00:01:05,460 --> 00:01:08,930
I will retire in a few years too

30
00:01:08,930 --> 00:01:19,580
I can die

31
00:01:19,580 --> 00:01:22,140
Get up

32
00:01:22,180 --> 00:01:23,260
you are a teacher

33
00:01:23,260 --> 00:01:24,540
kneel in front of students

34
00:01:24,540 --> 00:01:26,080
inappropriate

35
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:27,240
Mr. Chen

36
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:28,280
please

37
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:31,850
Don't let me lose my job

38
00:01:31,850 --> 00:01:35,020
Teacher Li

39
00:01:35,020 --> 00:01:37,020
We will not hold you accountable today

40
00:01:37,020 --> 00:01:38,740
I just want my children to learn tolerance

41
00:01:38,740 --> 00:01:41,100
I don’t want him to see too many ugly things about human nature

42
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:42,940
Not because we are afraid of anything

43
00:01:42,940 --> 00:01:44,420
Although we are poor

44
00:01:44,420 --> 00:01:45,820
But we are aboveboard

45
00:01:45,820 --> 00:01:47,220
Upright
